# Real-Time Notifications using Supabase Realtime

This PR transitions the notification system to a real-time WebSocket solution using Supabase Realtime, bridging NextAuth and Supabase via custom JWT minting.

## User Review Required
> [!WARNING]
> Since this bridges NextAuth with Supabase Realtime, it requires setting the `SUPABASE_JWT_SECRET` in your `.env` files. This secret must match the one used by your Supabase project (found in Project Settings -> API).

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The PR description mentioned creating `00009_broadcast_notifications.sql`. However, a `00009_realtime_setup.sql` already exists. I will create `00010_broadcast_notifications.sql` instead to ensure migrations apply cleanly in order.

